-- RECORD NEEDS NAMED FIELDS ------------------------------------ main.kl  K0416

I can't build this record from positional arguments. A record is always built with every field named, so a value can never land in the wrong field.

6│     let p = Point(1, 2)
               ^^^^^^^^^^^

Try: `x: `

Try: `y: `

Help: Name each field, for example `User(id: 1, name: "Sara")`. Fields with a default value may be left out.

Learn more: kalam explain K0416
